  "match": "fair",
  "gaps": "Walls use the generic stone block texture rather than knapped flint with stone quoins; tower has no clock, buttress or belfry louvres and the spire is a plain pyramid rather than a shingled broach spire; nave and chancel are one block with no chancel step; porch glazing is simplified; yew and lime trees are generic low-poly shapes; street, bench and roundabout in the foreground are not modelled."
